#%PAM-1.0
# PAM service profile for the IAA-VPN IdP.
#
# pam_vpnmfa.so is the IAA orchestrator (idp/pam_iaa/src/pam_vpnmfa.c).
# It reads the user's risk score from the PAM env var IAA_RISK_SCORE (set by
# idp/pam_bridge.py), decides which factors to require, and asks the bridge
# for each one via the conversation function. No HTTP, no curl, no arguments
# needed — see STEPS.md §2.4 and §2.5.

auth    required    pam_vpnmfa.so
account required    pam_permit.so
